            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cavern Escape</strong> is a challenging platformer puzzle game where precision and patience are the key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective is simple. Drag the small character to the exit using your mouse while avoiding walls and every obstacle standing in your way. It may seem easy at first, but each level becomes increasingly difficult and will put your reflexes and problem-solving skills to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have what it takes to reach the end?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 challenging levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of unique puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse-driven gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A casual puzzle experience with increasing difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true test of precision and skill.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How far can you go?</strong></p>",
